  "body": "[16.2](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#non-conforming-features) contains four occurrences of `use script to handle` (using code formatting to indicate that no spec formatting is being omitted).\r\n\r\nSomething seems to be missing which would make the intent clearer; these sentence fragments probably mean `use the <code>script</code> element to handle` (short `use <code>script</code> to handle`) or `use a script to handle`?",
